<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is moving to block exports of chemicals used in Myanmar rare-earth mining while promoting the ASEAN Express cross-border rail freight service. A Chanthaburi man confessed to an acid attack on his wife, an American tourist was killed after provoking an MMA fighter known as Frank the Tank in a Bangkok hotel lobby, and police seized RM2.5 million worth of syabu near the Kelantan border. Cambodia protested a Thai military visit and new bunker construction along their contested border. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE9NRUF4VXZDQXIwMTlsY2hFblNRSVZmaUcxN0VWOFFTc0J4cUtjLTFzMUV5ZlpHS2tEUHRYOUxjY29vWFJPT2RESTFJYUJsT083YVlvSm1KbDhmX0VxcWxMY1NVbm5FeGFFdE11TE5PVklrZnBvY2Zyaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chiang Rai Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Irish Mirror&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPRGI2eFNYQm1uMms3d1FabVI2VW05aFRvQTEwajF0TkxmaEp4R3dZLVJoVnpVMk1uVTUzN0FPWFNmeEU1NUxRaVRkOHg2bzNKU0JJT0xXSmhneDIxb1d0RlR5NHhzVEVwN3lNRGpkaDUzaWZxM3dMMkJwRDNQVWhhakxQbTNETm54d0ZZU1JPWVhDQVBqdUlxN0w0Yk9hamZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontier Myanmar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQM1RWVmN0TXRoNWpyYUtkQXNxVDM5UzFZeDVmWmpEdU1nQ0kzLWszVEgxWDg5UURxRmJVZ1NTUW9Ma19LWTVwOXB5YXZMVHB6ZW1zY05pTHVMT2JwaTh2Q3RqZ0pYZU9sU21OZzJHZ0dUUHd1Z1o4NThxOGt4SHNmeDRnSlYtMDFQQUxUS0lra1kxZlJCeTFzM21CdENUN1hvSHo1Mk9jUTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5ya2ZNLURrdHdGWWkzOWJ0Y3NNWmx6X2ZIOUhZcjdsRXQ5NzNlWUotTTFEM3B5Rnhqaldsakl5T